.TH MAGUS-GATE 1 "" "magus" "magus Manual"
.SH NAME
magus\-gate \- A person's decisions about the local gate
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B magus
.RI "gate <waive> [flags]"
.SS gate waive options
.RS
.TP
\fB\-\-reason\fR \fIstring\fR
Why the gate was skipped, recorded with the waiver; required unless \-\-revoke
.TP
\fB\-\-revoke\fR
Remove the commit's waiver
.RE
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.RS
.TP
\fBwaive\fR
Let one commit be pushed with no passing gate, typed by a person
.RE
.SH EXAMPLES
\fIPush HEAD without the local gate, saying why\fR
.PP
.EX
magus gate waive HEAD --reason "CI gates this release branch"
.EE
.PP
\fITake the waiver back\fR
.PP
.EX
magus gate waive --revoke HEAD
.EE
.PP
